msgid "Remove from my desktop…"
msgstr "Vom Desktop entfernen…"

#: cheeselooks/app.py:1009
msgid ""
"Before uninstalling Theme Roller: puts Mint's default theme back and takes Theme Roller's colors out of your apps"
